From b9209b0b07d1d547e4a4f76bbb50bfdb1ef97b9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:05:31 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(2d): re-trace fitted contour arcs along exit-point
 overlap

Project and extend contour_start::exit_at along the fitted walk (lines
and arcs) instead of raw polyline chords, and split an interior hit on
the first lap too so both laps share identical CL moves without XY
crossings.

Fixes #2195
